# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.3/Dollyfile-system 16346ea69e45c8758f56859bd65f3c680aa601c56efe92989a110de611c4c620
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 963b3f50bb6943a306e1dd25a34cc196cb8fab31bd5ed1456a8e29e49f745bee
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm f88786d934ffb20b659e3304e23e55524bd46405cad511517d3e6a90186d2b86
